#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:150
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EricIntro"
msgid ""
"MT. CHIMNEY's JAGGED PASS…\p"
"Now this is what I've always wanted\n"
"in a mountain.\p"
"This jagged bumpiness…\n"
"It rocks my soul!$"
msgstr ""
"烟囱山的凹凸山道……\p"
"这才是我一直梦寐以求的山。\p"
"这种崎岖不平的感觉……\n"
"真让我心潮澎湃！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:157
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EricDefeat"
msgid "Losing left me bitter!$"
msgstr "输了真让我不甘心！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:160
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EricPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Yes, I did lose at POKéMON…\p"
"But, when it comes to the love of\n"
"the mountains, I have you beat!$"
msgstr ""
"没错，宝可梦对战我是输了……\p"
"但要说对山的热爱，我可比你强！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:165
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaIntro"
msgid ""
"This place isn't your casual hike.\n"
"It's not suited for a picnic.$"
msgstr ""
"这里可不是随便走走的地方。\n"
"不适合野餐。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:169
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ohhh, no!\n"
"The ground is too bumpy…$"
msgstr "哎呀，不好！地面太不平了……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:173
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Did you know?\p"
"Some people cleverly ride their\n"
"bicycles up this horribly bumpy pass.$"
msgstr ""
"你知道吗？\p"
"有些人能巧妙地骑着自行车，\n"
"爬上这条崎岖得要命的山道。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:178
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaRegister"
msgid ""
"Will you ever be back in this area?\n"
"If you do return, I'd like a rematch.$"
msgstr ""
"你还会再来这一带吗？\n"
"如果你回来了，我想再和你比一场。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:182
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Picnics are fun wherever you go.\n"
"Just like POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"野餐不管去哪里都很开心。\n"
"就像宝可梦一样！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:186
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I only lost because the ground is\n"
"too bumpy!$"
msgstr "我会输，只是因为地面太不平了！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:190
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_DianaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'll forget about losing and just\n"
"enjoy this bumpy hike.$"
msgstr ""
"我要忘掉输了的事，\n"
"好好享受这段崎岖的登山路。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:194
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanIntro"
msgid ""
"JAGGED PASS is hard to walk on.\n"
"It's a good place for training.$"
msgstr "凹凸山道很难走。是个修行的好地方。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:198
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanDefeat"
msgid ""
"It was all over while we were still\n"
"trying to find a good footing…$"
msgstr ""
"我们还没找到站稳的地方，\n"
"就已经结束了……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:202
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If I had an ACRO BIKE, I'd be able to\n"
"jump ledges.$"
msgstr "要是我有越野自行车，就能跳过台阶了。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:206
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanRegister"
msgid ""
"When I get more used to this bumpiness,\n"
"I'll be sure to win!\p"
"Can you register me in your POKéNAV?$"
msgstr ""
"等我习惯了这种崎岖的路，\n"
"我一定会赢的！\p"
"能把我登记到你的宝可导航里吗？$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:211
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I got used to this bumpiness.\n"
"I sing while I climb now.$"
msgstr ""
"我已经习惯这种崎岖的路了。\n"
"现在我都能边爬边唱歌了。$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:215
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"It's still not easy to battle on this\n"
"bumpy ground…$"
msgstr ""
"在这么崎岖的地面上对战，\n"
"还是不容易啊……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:219
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_EthanPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I should get an ACRO BIKE from RYDEL\n"
"in MAUVILLE CITY…$"
msgstr ""
"我应该去紫堇市的\n"
"风野那里拿一辆越野自行车……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:223
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_GruntIntro"
msgid ""
"Wah!\n"
"What are you doing here?\p"
"What am I doing in a place like this?\p"
"What business is it of yours?$"
msgstr ""
"哇！你在这里干什么？\p"
"我在这种地方干什么？\p"
"关你什么事？$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:229
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_GruntDefeat"
msgid ""
"Urrrgh…\p"
"I should've ducked into our HIDEOUT\n"
"right away…$"
msgstr ""
"呜呜呜……\p"
"我早该马上躲进我们的基地里的……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:234
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_GoWhereverYouWant"
msgid ""
"Okay, oh-kay!\n"
"I admit it--you're strong!\p"
"Don't worry about me.\n"
"Go wherever you want!$"
msgstr ""
"好啦好啦！我承认——你很强！\p"
"别管我了。你想去哪儿就去哪儿吧！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:240
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_BoulderShakingInResponseToEmblem"
msgid ""
"Oh! This boulder is shaking in response\n"
"to the MAGMA EMBLEM!$"
msgstr ""
"哦！这块大岩石对熔岩队徽章产生反应，\n"
"摇晃起来了！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:244
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_JulioIntro"
msgid ""
"Aiyeeh! It's awfully scary to shoot\n"
"down the mountain in one go!$"
msgstr "哇啊啊！一口气冲下山实在是太可怕了！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:248
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_JulioDefeat"
msgid "I feel like I'm falling apart…$"
msgstr "我感觉自己快要散架了……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:251
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_JulioPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My bicycle bounced around so much,\n"
"my rear end's sore…$"
msgstr "自行车颠得太厉害了，我的屁股好痛……$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:255
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_AutumnIntro"
msgid ""
"I climb this hill every day.\n"
"I have confidence in my strength!$"
msgstr ""
"我每天都爬这座山。\n"
"我对自己的体力很有信心！$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:259
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_AutumnDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"What went wrong?$"
msgstr "嗯……哪里出错了呢？$"

#: data/maps/JaggedPass/scripts.inc:263
msgctxt "JaggedPass_Text_AutumnPostBattle"
msgid ""
"What is that odd rock protrusion\n"
"a little up the hill from here?$"
msgstr ""
"从这里再往山上走一点，有一块奇怪的\n"
"凸起的岩石，那是什么呢？$"
